{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13306","headline":"招隐寺送阎判官还江州 · 皇甫冉","name":"招隐寺送阎判官还江州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离别那逢秋气悲，东林更作上方期。\n共知客路浮云外，暂爱僧房坠叶时。\n长江九派人归少，寒岭千重雁度迟。\n借问浔阳在何处，每看潮落一相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}